# Copy this file to deploy/.env and fill in the real value.
# deploy/.env is gitignored — the real secret must never be committed.
#
# The automation user's secret. Pick a long random value up front:
#
#   uv run python -c "import secrets; print(secrets.token_urlsafe(24))"
#
# The same value is shared by the worker (wizard, provisioning/probe scripts)
# and the poller. The wizard's Phase 1 pushes it into Checkmk, creating the
# 'automation' user or updating its secret if it already exists. To change it
# later: edit this file, re-run the wizard's Phase 1, then recreate the
# poller and worker. Leave it empty to fall back to the wizard generating a
# random secret and printing it once (copy it here afterwards).
#
# Note: cmkadmin's login password does NOT work here — it has no automation
# secret and cannot Bearer-auth the REST API.
CMK_REST_SECRET=
